2873 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Delivered a 30\045 performance boost by eliminating unused assets\054 optimising the build pipeline\054 and implementing advanced front\055end performance strategies \024 directly improving Core Web Vitals and user retention\056\nDesigned and developed responsive\054 high\055performance ReactJS web apps\054 ensuring cross\055browser compatibility and seamless user experience across all devices\056\nCollaborated closely with UI\057UX designers in Figma to translate wireframes and high\055fidelity mock\055ups into pixel\055perfect\054 accessible front\055end interfaces with meticulous attention to detail\056\nAchieved the 30\045 performance improvement through lazy loading\054 tree\055shaking\054 removal of unused assets\054 image compression\054 and a fully streamlined build process optimisation pipeline\056\nIntegrated RESTful APIs and built robust form validation using React Hook Form\054 ensuring reliable data handling\054 error management\054 and smooth user interactions\056\nActively participated in Agile\057Scrum ceremonies \024 including daily stand\055ups\054 sprint planning\054 and retrospectives \024 maintaining clean\054 version\055controlled code across Git\057Bitbucket repositories\056)
     /K [ 10 ]
     /P 2874 0 R
     /Pg 2853 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
