  << /ActualText (Led the end\055to\055end redesign of a full LMS platform  \024 migrating the entire design workflow from Adobe XD to Figma\054 enabling real\055time team collaboration and cutting design\055to\055development handoff time significantly\056\nSpearheaded the migration of the complete design process from Adobe XD to Figma\054 establishing a collaborative\054 cloud\055based design workflow that improved team efficiency and real\055time feedback\056\nExecuted a full redesign of the LMS platform \024 reimagining dashboards\054 student portals\054 and admin panels using a component\055based design approach for long\055term consistency and maintainability\056\nBuilt and maintained a comprehensive Design System \024 defining reusable UI components\054 tokens\054 typography\054 spacing rules\054 and icon libraries to ensure visual consistency across the entire product\056\nCollaborated directly with developers through structured design handoff sessions\054 ensuring pixel\055perfect implementation and eliminating ambiguity between design intent and final output\056)
